 "Everything that has shipped in VRCVerify, newest first.": [
  "changelog.html"
 ],
 "Everything you need to verify your members is free, on every server, with no cap and nothing to start. Premium adds the automation around it, from verifying the members you already have in one go to clearing up unverified roles, syncing nicknames, sending VRChat group invites, bringing your group's calendar into Discord and posting its join requests for your moderators.": [
  "index.html"
 ],
 "For each Discord server: the server ID, its owner's Discord ID, the role and channel IDs it has configured, its chosen language, its feature settings, any custom post-verification message it has written, and a count of completed verifications. Where an administrator changes a setting on the dashboard, we record who changed what and when.": [
  "privacy.html"
 ],
